@api = http://localhost:5100

### 1. Health check (mong doi 200 OK)
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Lay danh sach san pham (mong doi 200 OK)
GET {{api}}/api/products

### 3. Lay chi tiet san pham id=1 (mong doi 200 OK)
GET {{api}}/api/products/1

### 4. Lay san pham khong ton tai id=999 (mong doi 404 Not Found + ApiError)
GET {{api}}/api/products/999

### 5. Sai kieu tham so route id=abc (mong doi 404 Not Found rong)
GET {{api}}/api/products/abc

### 6. Tao san pham moi hop le (mong doi 201 Created + Location)
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Thuc hanh Microservices",
  "description": "Tai lieu bo sung",
  "price": 180000
}

### 7. Tao san pham voi gia am (mong doi 400 Bad Request + ApiError)
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "San pham loi",
  "description": "Gia am khong hop le",
  "price": -5000
}

### 8. Gui POST thieu header Content-Type (mong doi 415 Unsupported Media Type)
POST {{api}}/api/products

{
  "name": "Thieu Content-Type",
  "description": "Test 415",
  "price": 100000
}

